        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY :</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Greys: Human Abductions, you step into the shoes of a man who has just inherited his brother's mysterious house after he went missing and was presumed dead. As you explore your brother’s home, you uncover a hidden attic filled with top-secret documents, recordings, and unsettling evidence of alien encounters. The further you delve into the mystery, the more you experience the same terror, as your brother, strange noises, unexplainable events, and even the terrifying possibility of alien abduction. Will you discover the truth behind your brother's disappearance, or will you become the next victim of the unknown forces at play?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features &amp; Gameplay :</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206550/extras/9b27b16e9a5200ff98cd5a513b337369.poster.avif?t=1759327266\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206550/extras/9b27b16e9a5200ff98cd5a513b337369.webm?t=1759327266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206550/extras/9b27b16e9a5200ff98cd5a513b337369.mp4?t=1759327266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>- Open drawers, pick up and inspect documents, play recordings, and interact with lights, doors, and hidden compartments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206550/extras/b9ca5c1452a846e58de25648e33e9c9a.poster.avif?t=1759327266\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206550/extras/b9ca5c1452a846e58de25648e33e9c9a.webm?t=1759327266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206550/extras/b9ca5c1452a846e58de25648e33e9c9a.mp4?t=1759327266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>- Solve intricate puzzles that involve finding keys, deciphering codes, and unlocking mysterious boxes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206550/extras/ef99bb8f0c4f176f14855962a974ab96.poster.avif?t=1759327266\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206550/extras/ef99bb8f0c4f176f14855962a974ab96.webm?t=1759327266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206550/extras/ef99bb8f0c4f176f14855962a974ab96.mp4?t=1759327266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>- Experience terrifying sounds of strange noises, footsteps, whispers, and eerie alien phenomena. The audio design is a core component of the game, amplifying the fear and dread as you explore and interact with the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play old VHS footage you find in the game! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206550/extras/4ffc4d98afe8ed9798c65f2593fc97d8.poster.avif?t=1759327266\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206550/extras/4ffc4d98afe8ed9798c65f2593fc97d8.webm?t=1759327266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206550/extras/4ffc4d98afe8ed9798c65f2593fc97d8.mp4?t=1759327266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unexplainable events occur, lights flicker, and shadows move in the corner of your eye. When strange events start to escalate, you’ll need to find places to hide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206550/extras/7d7e93df88a983d3941ac1c00c39cf4f.poster.avif?t=1759327266\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206550/extras/7d7e93df88a983d3941ac1c00c39cf4f.webm?t=1759327266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206550/extras/7d7e93df88a983d3941ac1c00c39cf4f.mp4?t=1759327266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>- The fear escalates as you dig deeper into the story. The more you uncover, the more real the danger becomes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206550/extras/e7d5b056f512e01a0b3960973c2974b2.poster.avif?t=1759327266\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206550/extras/e7d5b056f512e01a0b3960973c2974b2.webm?t=1759327266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206550/extras/e7d5b056f512e01a0b3960973c2974b2.mp4?t=1759327266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>- Game will have Multiple Endings and your choices throughout the game will affect the ending.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY :</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Greys: Human Abductions, you step into the shoes of a man who has just inherited his brother's mysterious house after he went missing and was presumed dead. As you explore your brother’s home, you uncover a hidden attic filled with top-secret documents, recordings, and unsettling evidence of alien encounters. The further you delve into the mystery, the more you experience the same terror, as your brother, strange noises, unexplainable events, and even the terrifying possibility of alien abduction. Will you discover the truth behind your brother's disappearance, or will you become the next victim of the unknown forces at play?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features &amp; Gameplay :</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206550/extras/9b27b16e9a5200ff98cd5a513b337369.poster.avif?t=1759327266\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206550/extras/9b27b16e9a5200ff98cd5a513b337369.webm?t=1759327266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206550/extras/9b27b16e9a5200ff98cd5a513b337369.mp4?t=1759327266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>- Open drawers, pick up and inspect documents, play recordings, and interact with lights, doors, and hidden compartments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206550/extras/b9ca5c1452a846e58de25648e33e9c9a.poster.avif?t=1759327266\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206550/